<title>UK: NordLB sets $135 million bond due Sept 1998.</title>
<headline>NordLB sets $135 million bond due Sept 1998.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    $135 MLN	COUPON     6.385     MATURITY    02.SEP.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    06.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  NONE	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 100	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
